      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8398136::chunk::000::abstract::92875111a7"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Molecular dynamics simulations can reveal thermodynamic contributions to the structural properties of AuCoCuNiPt nanoparticles.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8398136::chunk::000::abstract::92875111a7",
        "PMC6093928::chunk::000::abstract::b3f2cb8881"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial material is a nearly equiatomic AuCoCuNiPt nanoalloy.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The nanoparticles should be heated to high temperatures to study their thermal behavior.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8398136::chunk::000::abstract::92875111a7",
        "PMC6093928::chunk::000::abstract::b3f2cb8881"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A vacuum or inert atmosphere will prevent oxidation during heating.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heating affects atomic arrangement and lattice structure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6093928::chunk::000::abstract::b3f2cb8881",
        "PMC6197204::chunk::000::abstract::a6951d7e3c",
        "PMC10384371::chunk::000::abstract::5201bb0b99"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant mechanism is thermally activated diffusion and atomic rearrangement.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4999872::chunk::000::abstract::7a7d39c713",
        "PMC10384371::chunk::001::introduction::889f2a282a",
        "PMC11355469::chunk::001::introduction::201bec5221"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "AuCoCuNiPt nanoparticles will exhibit enhanced thermal stability because of the high-entropy effect.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10384371::chunk::001::introduction::889f2a282a",
        "PMC11355469::chunk::001::introduction::201bec5221",
        "PMC4999872::chunk::000::abstract::7a7d39c713"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The thermal behavior of the individual Au, Co, Cu, Ni, and Pt components is an appropriate baseline.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant simulation temperature range is 300–1000 K.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant simulation time scale is picoseconds to nanoseconds.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Molecular-dynamics accuracy depends on the selected interatomic potential.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
